			<Text>Ageless beauty.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_MEMENTO_ELIZABETH_MASK_OF_YOUTH_FUNCTIONAL_DESCRIPTION">
			<Text>[B]+1 [icon:YIELD_DIPLOMACY][/B] per [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_AGE_TOOLTIP]Age[/TIP] for each [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_CONTINENT_TOOLTIP]Continent[/TIP] you have a [TIP:LOC_PEDIA_CONCEPTS_SETTLEMENT_TOOLTIP]Settlement[/TIP] on.</Text>
